  id: marelune
  dexNumber: 180
  displayName: Marelune
  lore: The moon-tide. Islanders say the lagoon rises and falls because Marelune
    breathes, and that it carries the drowned moon on its brow so the sea is never
    dark.
  personality: Vast, gentle, older than the reef.
